arXiv:2509.25857v1 [cs.GR] 30 Sep 2025</div>
</div><div class="ltx_page_content">
<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<div id="p1" class="ltx_para"><span id="p1.1" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\teaser</span><img src="2509.25857v1/figs/teaser.png" id="p1.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:471/180;" width="471" height="180" alt="[Uncaptioned image]">
<p id="p1.2" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center"><span id="p1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_caption">
Our method converts an object video (top) into a sketch animation using 2D vector graphics (bottom). We propose a differentiable motion trajectory with a Bernstein basis (cross-frame curves, middle) to represent stroke control point movement across frames. Our approach improves temporal coherence and semantic consistency, and performs robustly with a small number of strokes and long videos.</span></p>
</div>
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Vector sketch animation generation with 
<br class="ltx_break">differentialable motion trajectories</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">X. Zhu<sup id="1" class="ltx_sup"><span id="1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">1</span></sup><a href="https://orcid.org/0000-0002-3100-8481" title="ORCID 0000-0002-3100-8481" class="ltx_ref ltx_orcid"><svg class="ltx_orcidlogo" height="1em" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 72 72" width="1em"><path style="--ltx-fill-color:#A6CE39;" d="M72,36 C72,55.884375 55.884375,72 36,72 C16.115625,72 0,55.884375 0,36 C0,16.115625 16.115625,0 36,0 C55.884375,0 72,16.115625 72,36 Z" fill="#A6CE39"></path><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FFFFFF;" fill="#FFFFFF" transform="translate(18.868966, 12.910345)"><polygon points="5.03734929 39.1250878 0.695429861 39.1250878 0.695429861 9.14431787 5.03734929 9.14431787 5.03734929 22.6930505 5.03734929 39.1250878"></polygon><path d="M11.409257,9.14431787 L23.1380784,9.14431787 C34.303014,9.14431787 39.2088191,17.0664074 39.2088191,24.1486995 C39.2088191,31.846843 33.1470485,39.1530811 23.1944669,39.1530811 L11.409257,39.1530811 L11.409257,9.14431787 Z M15.7511765,35.2620194 L22.6587756,35.2620194 C32.49858,35.2620194 34.7541226,27.8438084 34.7541226,24.1486995 C34.7541226,18.1301509 30.8915059,13.0353795 22.4332213,13.0353795 L15.7511765,13.0353795 L15.7511765,35.2620194 Z"></path><path d="M5.71401206,2.90182329 C5.71401206,4.441452 4.44526937,5.72914146 2.86638958,5.72914146 C1.28750978,5.72914146 0.0187670918,4.441452 0.0187670918,2.90182329 C0.0187670918,1.33420133 1.28750978,0.0745051096 2.86638958,0.0745051096 C4.44526937,0.0745051096 5.71401206,1.36219458 5.71401206,2.90182329 Z"></path></g></svg></a>
