<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S4.F3.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 3</span>: </span><span id="S4.F3.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Comparisons of 3 methods with different numbers of strokes.<span id="S4.F3.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> CLIPasso lacks temporal coherence; both CLIPasso and SketchVideo suffer from semantic loss with a small number of strokes, while our approach produces outstanding results with varying strokes.
</span></span></figcaption>
</figure>
